 126:C:/Workspaces/DAVE-4.3/WS_2016_09_02/XMC1300Stepper9201_V3.2/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_vadc.h ****  * @brief Versatile Analog to Digital Converter (VADC) driver for XMC microcontroller family.
 127:C:/Workspaces/DAVE-4.3/WS_2016_09_02/XMC1300Stepper9201_V3.2/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_vadc.h ****  *
 128:C:/Workspaces/DAVE-4.3/WS_2016_09_02/XMC1300Stepper9201_V3.2/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_vadc.h ****  * The XMC microcontroller provides a series of analog input channels connected to a cluster of Ana
 129:C:/Workspaces/DAVE-4.3/WS_2016_09_02/XMC1300Stepper9201_V3.2/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_vadc.h ****  * Converters using the Successive Approximation Register (SAR) principle to convert analog input v
 130:C:/Workspaces/DAVE-4.3/WS_2016_09_02/XMC1300Stepper9201_V3.2/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_vadc.h ****  * to discrete digital values.
 131:C:/Workspaces/DAVE-4.3/WS_2016_09_02/XMC1300Stepper9201_V3.2/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_vadc.h ****  * \if XMC1
 132:C:/Workspaces/DAVE-4.3/WS_2016_09_02/XMC1300Stepper9201_V3.2/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_vadc.h ****  * The XMC1x is based on Sample & Hold converters, where a cluster contains 2 Sample&Hold units whi
 133:C:/Workspaces/DAVE-4.3/WS_2016_09_02/XMC1300Stepper9201_V3.2/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_vadc.h ****  * converter.
 134:C:/Workspaces/DAVE-4.3/WS_2016_09_02/XMC1300Stepper9201_V3.2/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_vadc.h ****  * \endif
 135:C:/Workspaces/DAVE-4.3/WS_2016_09_02/XMC1300Stepper9201_V3.2/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_vadc.h ****  *
 136:C:/Workspaces/DAVE-4.3/WS_2016_09_02/XMC1300Stepper9201_V3.2/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_vadc.h ****  * Each converter of the ADC cluster can operate independent of the others, controlled by a dedicat
 137:C:/Workspaces/DAVE-4.3/WS_2016_09_02/XMC1300Stepper9201_V3.2/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_vadc.h ****  * registers and triggered by a dedicated group request source. The results of each channel can be 
 138:C:/Workspaces/DAVE-4.3/WS_2016_09_02/XMC1300Stepper9201_V3.2/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_vadc.h ****  * dedicated channel-specific result register or in a group-specific result register.<BR>
 139:C:/Workspaces/DAVE-4.3/WS_2016_09_02/XMC1300Stepper9201_V3.2/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_vadc.h ****  *
 140:C:/Workspaces/DAVE-4.3/WS_2016_09_02/XMC1300Stepper9201_V3.2/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_vadc.h ****  * The Versatile Analog to Digital Converter module (VADC) of the XMC comprises a set of converter 
 141:C:/Workspaces/DAVE-4.3/WS_2016_09_02/XMC1300Stepper9201_V3.2/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_vadc.h ****  * can be operated either independently or via a common request source that emulates a background c
 142:C:/Workspaces/DAVE-4.3/WS_2016_09_02/XMC1300Stepper9201_V3.2/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_vadc.h ****  * Each converter block is equipped with a dedicated input multiplexer and dedicated request source
 143:C:/Workspaces/DAVE-4.3/WS_2016_09_02/XMC1300Stepper9201_V3.2/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_vadc.h ****  * which together build separate groups.
